# Agon 05_portalpuzzle (42b935e4): layer 2 holds six War Wasps (MYSF e081202de/df, e08120329/2a/2b, e081201cc),
# layer 3 and 12 each hold a ScriptTeamAiMgr (e0c120433 on L3). For mfly4: the wasps' AreaLoaded runs
# JoinTeam with a TeamAiMgr present (natural first call: id invalid -> GetAssociatedTeamId -> join),
# the Activate/Alert/damage steps give the Damage/Alert arms, a second layer load re-delivers AreaLoaded.
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; layer 3
@f500 layer 2
@f800 objs MysteryFlyer; objs ScriptTeamAiMgr
@f900 send e081202de Activate; send e081202df Activate; send e08120329 Activate; send e0812032a Activate; send e0812032b Activate; send e081201cc Activate
@f1000 send e081202de Alert; send e081202df Alert
@f1400 obj e081202de; obj e081202df
@f1600 layer 12
@f2000 objs MysteryFlyer; objs ScriptTeamAiMgr
@f2100 damage e081202de 1 0 power
@f2110 obj e081202de
@f2150 damage e081202de 1 0 power
@f2200 damage e081202de 1 0 power
@f2250 damage e081202df 1 0 power
@f2300 damage e081202df 1 0 power
@f2400 kill e081202de
@f2500 objs MysteryFlyer
